p}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}restriction\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{RestrictionMap}_S(g,f,A,X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land g=f\\upharpoonright A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}restriction\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{RestrictionMap}_S(g,f,A,X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land g=f\\upharpoonright A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}map\\text{-}restriction\\text{-}map\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapRestrictionMap}_S(g,f,A,X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RestrictionMap}_S(g,f,A,X,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}map\\text{-}restriction\\text{-}map\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapRestrictionMap}_S(g,f,A,X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RestrictionMap}_S(g,f,A,X,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-map-restriction-map</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]